  "messageDefendersAttacking": "{0} from {1} are attacking your {2}.",
  "defName": "Jawa_HuttCartel",
  "label": "Hutt Cartel",
  "description": "Wealthy, decentralised and entirely transactional. The Cartel owns the oases and sells water at whatever the buyer can be made to pay, and it holds the only non-Imperial orbital node on the planet — the door off-world, and the reason everyone keeps taking its calls.\n\nIt is hostile the way a creditor is hostile. Nothing about it is personal, and everything about it is negotiable.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Jawa Patches (local)</color></i>",
