  "ideoName": "the Weight",
  "hiddenIdeo": false,
  "ideoDescription": "We have no word for what we believe, because belief is not worn and everything real is worn. Weight is rank. What is bolted to you was cut off somebody slower, and the one who cuts it off you will be told what we were told: it was never yours, you were only carrying it a while. Nothing is wasted in the warrens. Not the plate. Not the meat.",
