  "messageDefendersAttacking": "{0} from {1} are attacking your {2}.",
  "defName": "Jawa_FreeDroidEnclaves",
  "label": "Free Droid Enclaves",
  "description": "Battle droids abandoned after the war who woke up and decided they belong to themselves. They settle on water and crack it for fuel, so an attacker arrives thirsty at a source it cannot drink.\n\nThey do not take prisoners and they do not hold grudges. What they hold is the water, and a memory of being property that they intend never to repeat.\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Jawa Patches (local)</color></i>",
